      "lineNbr": 431,
      "author": {
        "id": 1083225
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-06T10:52:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e But maybe it\u0027s better to have admins use X-RunAs and the query account API to debug that?\n\nAdding logging is better because it enables AI to self-debug the issue in the future.\n\nThese integrations are already in the work in most companies I believe.",
      "parentUuid": "286cbf2f_af211acb",
      "revId": "dc2a8774d503634f343bbfa10f240e6e9dc68784",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
